{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281190","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028119001:0":{"text":"여러분 말이 맞아요. 몬스터들, 오염, 왜곡된 기억들... 두려워해선 안 돼요.","source_cn":"你们说得对。这些魔物，污染，和扭曲的回忆……我不该害怕它们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE138351285E94B63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028119002:0":{"text":"이곳의 부패는 많은 동료들이 힘을 모아 정화했어요. 저 혼자서 모든 걸 구할 수는 없었지만, 제가 할 수 있는 모든 것을 바쳤어요.","source_cn":"这里的腐化已经被很多很多的同伴一起清除了。我无法一个人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D697D15A71BCB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028119003:0":{"text":"물은 생명과 융합의 힘이에요. 수많은 물방울이 모여야만 희망의 강이 될 수 있어요.","source_cn":"水是生命和汇聚的力量。许多的水滴聚在一起，才是希望的河流。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D14351FEE7DAAD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028119004:0":{"text":"저는 나약하지만 여기 있는 여러분과 함께라면 강해질 수 있어요!","source_cn":"我是很弱小，可和这里的每一个人汇聚在一起，我们就会很强大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D5C507DCC00B64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028119005:0":{"text":"휴윈 양... 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"伊温小姐，你……没事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE31A7391845EE5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028119006:0":{"text":"네... 몬스터를 막아줘서 고마워요.","source_cn":"嗯……谢谢你们阻拦这些魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ED21CE12D7C7D83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028119007:0":{"text":"아직 힘이 완전히 회복된 건 아니지만, 저도 같이 싸우게 해주세요!","source_cn":"虽然我的力量还没有完全恢复，但请让我和你们一起战斗吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8CFFD9F520D06C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028119008:0":{"text":"마지막 한 마리만 남았어요! 휴윈 양, 같이 해치워요!","source_cn":"只剩最后一只魔物了！伊温小姐，我们一起干掉它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CDD12160E00FD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}